== Translation Credit ==
Template for crediting translations and their translators. This should be placed at the bottom of translated content.
== Usage ==
<pre>
{{Translation Credit
|type=community
|translator=username
|date=YYYY.MM.DD
|notes=Additional information
|revision_info=Revision history
}}
</pre>
== Parameters == 
{| class="wikitable" 
! Parameter 
! Required 
! Description 
! Example(s) 
|- 
| type 
| No 
| Type of translation: "official", "community", "collaborative" <br>Defaults to "community" 
| type=official 
|- 
| translator 
| Yes 
| Name(s) of translator(s) 
| translator=JohnDoe <br>translator=User1, User2, and User3 
|- 
| date 
| No 
| Date of translation (YYYY.MM.DD) 
| date=2024.01.15 
|- 
| notes 
| No 
| Additional information about the translation 
| notes=From CD booklet 
|- 
| revision_info 
| No 
| Information about revisions or updates 
| revision_info=Updated by User2 (2024.02.01) 
|} 
== Examples ==
=== Official Translation === 
<pre>
{{Translation Credit
|type=official
|translator=Sony Music Japan
|date=2024.01.15
|notes=From official album booklet
}}
</pre>
Output: {{Translation Credit
|type=official
|translator=Sony Music Japan
|date=2024.01.15
|notes=From official album booklet
}}

=== Community Translation ===
<pre>
{{Translation Credit
|type=community
|translator=username
|date=2024.01.15
|notes=Checked by native speaker
}}
</pre> 
Output: {{Translation Credit
|type=community
|translator=username
|date=2024.01.15
|notes=Checked by native speaker
}} 

=== Collaborative Translation === 
<pre>
{{Translation Credit
|type=collaborative
|translator=user1, user2, and user3
|date=2024.01.15
|notes=Group translation project
|revision_info=Reviewed by user4 (2024.02.01)
}}
</pre> 
Output:{{Translation Credit
|type=collaborative
|translator=user1, user2, and user3
|date=2024.01.15
|notes=Group translation project
|revision_info=Reviewed by user4 (2024.02.01)
}}